   "text": "Please keep in mind that you'll be responsible for the cost and safe return of the goods, including return shipping fees. We highly recommend insuring high-value items for peace of mind during the returns process.\nIf your returned goods do not meet the criteria outlined in this Policy, we'll work with you to cover the cost of returning your items to your nominated address.",
